#: ../../tapes/inventory.rst:13 356b655aae114f06bf73c706414a6909
msgid ""
"**Tapes → Inventory** on the library page, or **Operator → Tapes**, at "
"``/libraries/operator/tapes/``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tapes/inventory.rst:16 e57c2bcde4e24157b751be6234c7b5d6
msgid "The tape inventory for a library"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tapes/inventory.rst:20 eb7cabe981a14bd98cab483df8cf9e66
msgid ""
"The library page shows the same tapes as tiles, which is the quickest way"
" to see whether anything is filling up: a bar per tape, and how much room"
" is left under it. The bar is blue while there is room, amber past 75%, "
"and red past 90%."
msgstr ""

